{"server":"jp","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-07_beg","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-07","title":"とどろく","storyCode":"3-7","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"8d5bc811e73ca19e17283622bd2c957c31db5e89bcd99c06bdd90e5725a17a34","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十九关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"――第一防衛ライン突破！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"くそっ、術師たちは何をやってるんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"向こうの前衛はたった一人なんだぞ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"このままあいつに突破されちまうのを黙って見てるつもりかよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"とにかく急げ！　さっさと仕留めろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"フランカ！　前に出すぎ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"それじゃカバーできないでしょ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"あら、あたしが考えなしにこんなことするとでも思ってるの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"――言ってる間に……！　四時方向、来るよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"じゃあ、そっちはお願いね、リスカム！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"ああいう遠距離攻撃からは、あなたが守ってくれるでしょ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"っあ～、もう……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今だ、やれっ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"剣を持った奴から潰すんだ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"よし、うまくいっ――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……え？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"くだらん真似を。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"この程度の攻撃で、どうにかできるとでも？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"うわっ！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"こ、こいつ……一体どこから降りてきたんだ！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"借りができちゃったわね、おっきな刑事さん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"ははっ、光栄です。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"しかし、フランカさん。あなたのご担当は陽動であるとお見受けします。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"それでも、ここまで深く敵陣に斬り込むというのは……さすがに目立ちすぎるのでは？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"大丈夫よ。こういう時こそ、パートナーを信じなくちゃ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"はぁ、はあ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"フランカ！　さっきから、前に出すぎだってば！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"フランカ","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"ね？　追いついてきたでしょ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"ちょっと、聞いてるの……！？　わたし、こういう無茶は苦手なんだからね！　……まったく、こんなふうに突っ込んでいくなんて、ほんと理解できないよ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"……っと、おや？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"くっ……あいつら……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局とロドスで手を組んでやがったのか！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"これじゃ、俺たちには止めようがない……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"こうなったら、イチかバチかだ！　全員でかかるぞ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"――！　あいつら、突っ込んでくる！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"くたばりやがれ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"あくまで抵抗を続けるか。ならば、法に則り、処断を下そう。――恨んでくれるなよ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"てめえっ――！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"――はァッ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"レユニオン構成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"うわあああっ！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"……ホシグマさんって、すごく力持ちですね……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"リスカム","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"なんだかレユニオンが気の毒に見えてきました。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"実際、哀れな連中ですよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"何せ、我々に刃向かってしまったのですから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"とはいえ、こうした手合いは、これまで人を傷つけ、殺めた分の罪を償うべきなのです。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"ホシグマさん、ご無事で何よりです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"そちらも、お怪我はないようですね。よかった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"はい！　我々とペンギン急便の連携で、向こうの側面部隊を制圧しました。続けて、総攻撃に出ようと思います。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"了解しました。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"テキサス","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"今のところ、すべて順調に進んでいるな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"ですが、正念場はここからです。奴らは障害物を多く設置していますし、伏兵の配置も巧妙になってくることでしょう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"厳しい戦いを想定して、備えるべきかと。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ホシグマ","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"合わせて、Dr.{@nickname}には、味方の安全確保優先で、索敵にも気を配っていただけると幸いです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"なるほど、わかりました！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アーミヤ","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"それでは……行きましょう、みなさん。ミーシャさんを助けに！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["アーミヤ"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["テキサス"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["フランカ"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["リスカム"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["ホシグマ"]}]}
